{
  "name": "Sine Line",
  "notes": "Port of `sine_line`: a line swung across the strip by a sine, `pos = 0.5 + sin * (0.5 - len/2)`.\n\nTHE TRAVEL TERM IS THE WHOLE OF WHAT WAS MISSING. `0.5 - len/2` keeps the line's ENDS inside the strip rather than its centre, so a long line swings less far -- and it is a product of the oscillator and a parameter, which a row's fixed depth cannot express. It is two rows on one target: `M0 * 0.5` plus `math(mul, M0, L0.emitter.length) * -0.5`, which sums to `sin * (0.5 - len/2)` exactly. A parameter is a SOURCE, so the math node reads the length the `len` knob is currently asking for; the reading is one frame stale and the length changes only when a thumb moves it.\n\n`08-sine-bass` uses the identical pair for the identical reason, and there the length is moving every frame.\n\nNOT ROOM-LOCKED, and the original is: `sine_line` is the animation `trackRoomPhase()` was written for. `LfoSignal::phase` is writable precisely so a room clock could drive it and nothing wires MeshClock to it -- LIFE-676. Two strips running this drift apart.",
  "layers": {
    "0": {
      "emitter": {
        "type": "line",
        "params": {
          "centre": 0.5,
          "length": 0.05,
          "softness": 0
        }
      },
      "colour": {
        "index": "density",
        "palette": {
          "params": {
            "hueShift": -1
          },
          "entries": [
            "ffffff"
          ]
        }
      },
      "blend": "add",
      "opacity": 0,
      "order": 0
    }
  },
  "modulators": {
    "0": {
      "type": "lfo",
      "wave": "sine",
      "params": {
        "rate": 0.1
      }
    },
    "1": {
      "type": "math",
      "op": "mul",
      "source": 0,
      "sourceOut": 0,
      "sourceB": "L0.emitter.length",
      "params": {}
    },
    "2": {
      "type": "macro",
      "name": "hue",
      "label": "Hue",
      "params": {
        "knob": 0.5
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "type": "macro",
      "name": "brightness",
      "label": "Brightness",
      "params": {
        "knob": 1
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "type": "macro",
      "name": "len",
      "label": "Length",
      "params": {
        "knob": 0.33333333333333337
      }
    },
    "5": {
      "type": "macro",
      "name": "freq",
      "label": "Speed",
      "params": {
        "knob": 0.08163265306122448
      }
    }
  },
  "matrix": [
    {
      "src": 0,
      "dst": "L0.emitter.centre",
      "depth": 0.5,
      "bipolar": true
    },
    {
      "src": 1,
      "dst": "L0.emitter.centre",
      "depth": -0.5,
      "bipolar": true
    },
    {
      "src": "hue",
      "dst": "L0.palette.hueShift",
      "depth": 2,
      "bipolar": true
    },
    {
      "src": "brightness",
      "dst": "L0.layer.opacity",
      "depth": 1,
      "bipolar": true
    },
    {
      "src": "len",
      "dst": "L0.emitter.length",
      "depth": 0.45,
      "bipolar": true
    },
    {
      "src": "freq",
      "dst": "M0.rate",
      "depth": 4.9,
      "bipolar": true
    }
  ],
  "surface": [
    {
      "key": "hue",
      "label": "Hue",
      "type": "slider",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 50,
      "target": "M2.knob",
      "lo": 0,
      "hi": 1
    },
    {
      "key": "brightness",
      "label": "Brightness",
